<title>USA: IPO FILING - TVX Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - TVX Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			 TVX Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			TVAI.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $14-$16/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2,666,667</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2,666,667</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    7,362,372</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter	   BT Securities Corp</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  400,000 shrs Note: Concurrently with the completion of the offering, TVX will acquire Active Imaging PLC, based in the United Kingdom.</p>
<p>Completion of the offering is contingent upon the consummation of the acquisition. Active Imaging develops and markets proprietary and jointly owned imaging products.</p>
<p>Business: The Golden, Colo., develops and distributes digital image management systems for the security and survellance industry, the transportation management industry and Internet video applications.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: Pay anticipated cash portion of the acquisition, retirement of existing debt, general corporate purposes, including research and development and marketing expenses, building or obtaining manufacturing capability, transactions fees and expenses, integration of the company's operations following the acquisition and redemption of the stock issues.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Sept 30:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>  - Revenue		$1,033,920	 $1,071,019</p>
<p>  - Net Income (loss) ($3,001,748)     ($3,035,019)</p>
